{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-4","name":"プロデューサー","text":"────先攻、どうぞ","trans":"────先攻，请","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901025200010","name":"透","text":"えー\r\n無理無理","trans":"诶——\n不行不行","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-7","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……じゃ、後攻でいいぞ","trans":"……那，后攻也可以","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-9","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……\r\n棄権はなしだって、約束したじゃ────","trans":"……\n不是说好了不能弃权的吗────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901025200020","name":"透","text":"無理だって\r\nあーんじゃなきゃ","trans":"说了不行\n不喂我“啊——”就不行","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-12","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……\r\n透ー……","trans":"……\n透——……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-16","name":"プロデューサー","text":"────いや、俺は大丈夫だよ\r\n自分で食べるから","trans":"────不，我没关系\n我自己吃就行","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901025200070","name":"透","text":"オッケー、左ね\r\nはい、あー……","trans":"好，左边是吧\n来，啊——……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-19","name":"プロデューサー","text":"だ、大丈夫だって、透──────","trans":"我说了没、没事的，透──────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901025200080","name":"透","text":"────……\r\nいい。じゃ","trans":"────……\n好。那","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-22","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……透\r\nす、すまん…………","trans":"……透\n抱、抱歉…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901025200090","name":"透","text":"────なにそれ\r\nすっぱい顔","trans":"────那是什么\n好酸的表情","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-30","name":"プロデューサー","text":"────俺が食べさせたって、\r\nべつに面白くもなんともないぞ……","trans":"────就算我喂你，\n也没什么好玩的哦……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901025200030","name":"透","text":"すっぱいか甘いかだから\r\n面白いかどうかじゃなくて","trans":"只看是酸还是甜\n跟好不好玩没关系","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901025200040","name":"透","text":"はい、あー……","trans":"来，啊——……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-37","name":"プロデューサー","text":"す、すっぱいか……！？\r\nほら、変な食べ方したから──────","trans":"很、很酸吗……！？\n你看，都怪吃得那么奇怪──────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901025200060","name":"透","text":"すっぱい、めっちゃ……\r\n──────すっぱくて……甘い","trans":"好酸，超级……\n──────又酸……又甜","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}